# A checkout with core.autocrlf on rewrites LF to CRLF on the way out, which
# reports files as modified while `git diff` shows no changed lines at all -- and
# for anything with an interpreter line it is worse than cosmetic, because
# `#!/bin/bash\r` fails with "cannot execute: required file not found".
#
# The index holds LF, so pinning these changes no content; it stops the checkout
# undoing it.
*.R     text eol=lf
*.h     text eol=lf
*.hpp   text eol=lf
*.cpp   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.tsv   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
